  "solution": "Gọi vectơ pháp tuyến của mặt phẳng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> lần lượt là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mover><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tVì <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>d</mi></semantics></math> là  giao tuyến của <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>d</mi></semantics></math> có vecto chỉ phương là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mover><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>;</mo><mover><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tDo đó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>:</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℝ</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Sai. <br>\n\t\t\tTa có: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>. Nên VTCP <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>:</mo><mover><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tMà <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>. Do đó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>:</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℝ</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tMà <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>5</mn><mn>14</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>H</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>5</mn><mn>14</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>5</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>15</mn><mn>14</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Đúng. Vì ta có:<br>\n\t\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇔</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tDo đó đường thẳng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>d</mi></semantics></math> đi qua điểm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Sai.<br> \n\t\t\tGọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> là mặt phẳng chứa điểm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math> và vuông góc với <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>. Khi đó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>K</mi></semantics></math> là giao điểm của <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mo>⇒</mo></semantics></math> VTPT của <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>:</mo><mover><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tDo đó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/19